\* All TLC check configs for AntflyLiveSourceCardinality.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPreMoveOwner = FALSE
    BuggyPreserveLiveCardinality = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK

PROPERTIES
    DeleteEventuallyPublishesZero

==== BadPreMoveOwner
\* Updating the wrapper at its construction address leaves the stable managed
\* writer's identity cache at the pre-delete cardinality.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPreMoveOwner = TRUE
    BuggyPreserveLiveCardinality = FALSE

PROPERTIES
    DeleteEventuallyPublishesZero

==== BadPreserveLiveCardinality
\* Artifact anti-regression must not overwrite an authoritative live decrease
\* in primary-source cardinality.
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPreMoveOwner = FALSE
    BuggyPreserveLiveCardinality = TRUE

PROPERTIES
    DeleteEventuallyPublishesZero
